Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:11.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:17.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:24.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:30.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:47.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:53.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:01:00.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:06.09,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:12.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:24.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.09,0:01:47.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一大群百鬼蝙蝠…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第74话 破除结界的红色铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是百鬼蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往村子的方向去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还在发什么呆 走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子被…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要在意 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是欺负你与你母亲的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:58.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安心吧 只要你好好保护结界与我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:02.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就会救你母亲的命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用客气 吞掉整个村子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.35,0:03:20.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死老头 我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碍眼的臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:34.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:41.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 弥勒 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.71,0:03:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很慢耶 在磨蹭什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:52.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来到底有几只啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:54.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样根本没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.69,0:03:56.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杂鱼就由我对付
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:03:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:07.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:10.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然能轻易弹回飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:17.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要紫织在 我就无法使用风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,束手无策了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:27.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:31.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有办法将紫织 从大狱丸的身边拉开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:33.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想办法对付他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:38.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会被杀光的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:44.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用你们拜托 我也会砍了大狱丸那老头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:47.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是是在夺回紫织之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样太慢了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更重要的是 紫织是百鬼蝙蝠的同伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要一起杀掉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:04:58.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是不得已的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:01.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫紫织是妖怪的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好过分…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然为了村子 而让紫织与母亲分离
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送到百鬼蝙蝠的巢穴里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:10.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是任性的一群人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.93,0:05:12.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:16.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉不是最讨厌这种家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:21.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为曾经遭受相同的待遇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吧 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:28.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:35.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到有这些家伙的村子里 说不定也不会有啥好事喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:38.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算这样还是想回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:39.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:42.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是白天与妈妈 一起来到巢穴的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:46.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使这样你还是想回来 我就帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:48.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮她？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:55.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你以为你打的赢我大狱丸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:05:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:09.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 你也是半妖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:12.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑身都是半妖的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:15.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 是又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:21.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是把紫织 想成和自己一样而可怜她的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是很讨厌你这种臭老头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:32.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人…和我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:36.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织 马上做决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:39.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要回去还是不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:43.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想回去…回到妈妈的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:45.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吧 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:00.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不以结界保护我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:03.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你母亲的性命就不保
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:10.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:13.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 不要蛊惑紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:15.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织 你只要保护自己就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.64,0:07:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是结界的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得好 紫织 这样就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:51.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然 我想只要让大狱丸\N身体的一部分离开结界就有胜算
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是紫织好像还无法 自由控制结界的大小
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险 大家快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:25.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:28.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这村子已经没有用了 你们全都去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大狱丸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再继续下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:41.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:47.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子在你儿子月夜丸 活着的时候是很和平的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为月夜丸殿下保护了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:56.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他希望我与紫织平静生活 而没有袭击这个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:08:59.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:04.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你了解月夜丸所留下的心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.31,0:09:18.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子所留下的心愿？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月夜丸…既是我的儿子 也是愚蠢的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:31.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会迷恋人类女人 所以才这么早断送性命
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你所说 月夜丸说过要保护这个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:43.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不成全他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:48.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就舍弃继承自我大狱丸 守护结界的地位
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.97,0:09:51.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至不惜离开我族
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙已经连心 都让人类女人夺去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:09:58.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会将自己的儿子…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:16.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是我送月夜丸上路的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有了紫织 就不需要那小子了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:29.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母 您振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:33.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大狱丸 我绝对饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:36.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要砍了你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是正如所见 紫织还没有能控制结界大小的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一你的刀劈开结界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.53,0:10:53.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时紫织也会和我一起死的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:59.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有胜算吗 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够不伤害紫织 只砍到大狱丸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织还无法控制结界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:12.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算顺利击破结界 也会连大狱丸与紫织都…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:19.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎样砍我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.56,0:11:21.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 老鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再手下留情了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:26.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前都是手下留情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就让我见识一下 你的真本事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:34.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:46.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的结界因为那老头 吐出妖气的洞而打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破的漩涡应该 能通过那里击中老头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子刀的妖气竟然 将我的妖气卷入向我冲过来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:12:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样贯穿那老头的脑袋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界扭曲了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:17.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又恢复原状了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:29.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大狱丸毫发无伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是差了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:37.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好紫织 就这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:44.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是父亲的仇人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的紫织 不过是个半妖竟然将我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:09.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 这丫头竟然拥有这种程度的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:16.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连我大狱丸都无法如此自由的操纵结界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:18.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:31.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算孙女是半妖 也绝对不能将紫织交给人类
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:33.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母 危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.07,0:13:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:41.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老鬼快上路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:46.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位~
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:10.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.11,0:14:15.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:16.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:26.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你受苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 再待着也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.53,0:14:36.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家 回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么 犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:42.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷 你还在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你忘记来这里的目的了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是应该要砍杀 布下强大结界的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:55.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让铁碎牙吸取鲜血 以创造更强的铁碎牙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是来砍杀紫织的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:00.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没沦落到会去砍那小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:07.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方是那么小的女生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且都是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:12.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再去找能布下 更强大结界的坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:14.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后砍了他就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:17.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前不是这种人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思 就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是犬夜叉成长了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:30.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我们告辞了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:31.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:32.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:53.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砍这颗玉？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你砍了它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.61,0:16:00.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这颗血玉珊瑚是 负责守护百鬼蝙蝠结界之人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代代相传的宝玉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能引出守护者的力量 制造强大的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且据说它积蓄着代代的守护者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:16.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的爷爷与父亲的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:18.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想 如果砍了它
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.86,0:16:23.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的刀的妖力应该就能更强
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可求之不得啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:28.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷 快点砍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.41,0:16:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我也觉得 早点解决掉它比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从玉散发出邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.39,0:16:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快放手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.09,0:16:48.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 你的手…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玉张开了结界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:57.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不让我们那么简单的砍了它吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:17:00.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:04.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:25.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别想逃走 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:28.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是爷爷的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:34.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开玉也无法切断与我们一族的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你是人类母亲所生的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大狱丸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:41.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:45.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:47.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死老鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织！和我一起下地狱吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:57.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被弹开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:12.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:20.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老鬼的妖力变弱了 趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:25.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让紫织自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玉破掉了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次真的结束了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:57.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀刃变红了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:19:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙吸取了玉的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.89,0:19:03.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是刀变强了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:20.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:23.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你帮了我的忙不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.11,0:19:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你减弱了那老鬼的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 那不是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有人用温柔的手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.39,0:19:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱住了我与妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是月夜丸殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你父亲的手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.44,0:19:52.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯父的愿望一定也是 紫织能够自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:01.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子好饿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:03.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:08.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也想要拯救紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.29,0:20:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定连让铁碎牙变强的事都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:20.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以伯父的思念 才会助犬夜叉一臂之力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:30.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉在想些什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷居然也会沉思 真是稀奇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:38.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.47,0:20:43.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 往后那对母女会很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做多余的操心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是怕辛苦怎么当半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 这里就有个榜样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不那么别扭就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:01.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.29,0:21:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样才像是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:06.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是会沉思的犬夜叉 就不像犬夜叉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:14.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不习惯的事情就别再做了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你们丢下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.57,0:21:21.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 我们是在担心你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:25.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要当我是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:28.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掉下去我不管喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:33.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉在离别的时候 什么话都没有对紫织说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:37.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是要加油 要更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:40.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿出勇气来等等的话 应该有很多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想犬夜叉是用话语 以外的方式传达给紫织吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.17,0:21:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定传达到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.74,0:21:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:21:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我说不要把我当狗啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:21:59.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:01.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你也来这套
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要发飚啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.49,0:22:08.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉呀呀 真不该跟来的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:20.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:27.50,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.81,0:22:34.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:40.61,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:47.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.69,0:22:54.50,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.94,0:23:01.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:08.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:14.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.09,0:23:21.55,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.83,0:23:28.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:35.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.22,0:23:50.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,春夏秋冬四姐弟 率领的猫妖一族
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:52.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,豹猫族从西边来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.36,0:23:55.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的目标是四魂碎片与犬夜叉少爷的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.13,0:23:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些家伙我根本不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:23:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事情的源由是五十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.83,0:24:02.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与杀生丸少爷有关的那场大战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不正好是犬夜叉被封印的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.71,0:24:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.14,0:24:09.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,豹猫四天王的阴谋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.08,0:24:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思 我奉陪到底！
